Discover the flagship tablet — a versatile helper for studying, working, and entertainment!

A bright 11-inch display with a resolution of 3000×1440 ensures stunning detail and vivid colors — perfect for movies, lectures, and streams.

Powerful hardware guarantees impeccable performance:

8-core processor — for smooth interface operation;

16 GB RAM — efficient multitasking without delays;

2 TB SSD — huge library of games, movies, and documents;

microSD support up to 1 TB — additional memory expansion.

Android 15 provides access to millions of apps in Google Play, while modern communication standards — Wi-Fi 6, 4G, and 5G LTE (with SIM card support) — ensure stable internet anywhere.

The large 12,500 mAh battery lasts up to 9 hours — enough for a long gaming session or movie marathon. The set includes a stylish protective case-stand for comfortable viewing.

Full 12-month warranty confirms the reliability of the device. Choose performance and comfort — choose the next-generation tablet!
